Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.48,0:00:03.53,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,0)\c&HE6E7E4&}Thank You, Daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maraud. Merde.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I broke my promise to Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marauders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megimonose,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, give me your hand. What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma entrusted this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little present\Nfor your 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's from Dad? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love it so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what it is. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the sun god!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma just said it was a good luck charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could have imagined?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma saw promise in\Nthat boy two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now he's turned into\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, is it true Straw Hat\Nis my dad's best friend's son? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was surprised when you\Ntwo arrived here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate can work in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been in that room\Nfor a while, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've missed out on quite a number\Nof happenings here on Egghead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, Straw Hat Luffy and his\Ncrew just saved me from a deadly pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you up to speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll join them\Nonce you've rested a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly am sorry, Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a paltry hired hand, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.14,0:01:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:01:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.94,0:02:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,854)\fscx100\fscy100\fnRoboto\b1\bord5\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\blur0.7}Present Day
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.94,0:02:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,854)\fnRoboto\b1\blur0.7\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\c&H000101&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}Present Day
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,972)\fscx100\fscy100\fnRoboto\b1\bord5\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\blur0.7}Egghead, New World
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,972)\fnRoboto\b1\blur0.7\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\c&H000101&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}Egghead, New World
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we going to get out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hungry food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody get me meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could, but I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's bodyguard,\NSentomaru, has been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, pirate jewelry, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father, Bartholomew Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one below the rank of Commodore\Ncan enter, so we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen today's news?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the new Emperor of\Nthe Sea just took a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, it's quite the bold move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd wager some bloodshed is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says the Navy sent more\Nbattleships than they sent to Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Dr.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.46,0:03:54.30,Typeset things,,0,0,0,,{\org(1359.91,106.45)\pos(1346.56,120.45)\fnFOT-ロダン Pro UB\b0\fs50\blur0.6\c&H070707&\fax0.687231\fscx77.72\fscy69.28\frz0.6570\frx4.2734\fry3.1980\xbord0.00\ybord0.00}Straw Hats' Hostage Situation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk is alright
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch you silly billies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And kablam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time, I want to see it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't see it out of my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You greedy boys and girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're insatiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Kuma is being driven by a\Nfragment of his remaining psyche.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were him, where would you go, Eva?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd march my cyborg butt straight\Nto Marie Joie and open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kuma isn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to join your\Nfather in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Distorted future!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika? Future!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got weaker again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are that fool's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that is all you know, a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Ntalking about, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems she truly is crudous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hasn't made the connection\Nbetween Nika and Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gave Straw Hat all of that food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't give him anything, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuff him with Sea Prism Stone at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't change his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be wondering\Nwhy your strength is waning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where your power came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was given to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were given a Devil Fruit extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered if an infant who could not\Neat solid food could be granted power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the AJ's fruit is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It allows you to transform into any\Npossible future version of yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as you learn
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to face reality, you begin to see\Nthat your potential is quite narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to believe that\NNika is real, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been searching for him ever\Nsince you took my dad from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew if I found him, he'd\Nhave the power to set dad free!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, your weakening power is proof\Nthat your faith in Nika is ebbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father also believed in\Nthat foolish buccaneer legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember what he said\Nto me many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be like Nika and\Nprotect people from suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before she died, your mother was the\Neighth wife of someone from the Holy Land,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I conducted drug experiments on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they were a failure, and\Nthose blue blemishes appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disappointment aside, it was interesting\Nthat her child inherited the side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think something fell from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was your experiment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sapphire scales took\NKuma's family apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sacrificed himself to save\Nhis daughter from that sickness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you acted like your deal\Nwas a favor to him! Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You failed to see this\Nfrom my perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Doctor, do you concern yourself\Nwith the feelings of mere insects?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a pacifista? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has paw pads on his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the real Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on the southwestern shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:11:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the former warlord of the sea,\NBartholomew Kuma, has appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's advancing towards\Nthe island's center!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The authority chip isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no way to stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma's here? But bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going on about, Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.78,0:11:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open fire now! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it would be easier
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I gave up and died right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is insufferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, you noisy brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot her in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worked so hard to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put all of you, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening, Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, buccaneer boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will live as a\Nslave, then you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is your lot in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mother's in heaven now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.12,0:15:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, it's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumachi, I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kumachi, but\NI'm going to die soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed him when the\Nrevolutionaries took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have self-destructed already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pressed the switch myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C-Saturn, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what now? Do we stay put?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Kuma do all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He backed one of the five elders!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the highest\Nauthority in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lost his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A slave just struck an elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's completely unheard of!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rescue Saint Saturn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's buried under the collapsed buildings!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All thanks to Kuma, huh?\NHey, Bonnie! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no time to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab Bonnie and we can\Nhead up to the sunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have to win this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grab Comane, take him with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never installed that\Nself-destruct switch in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feared that if I turned you into a bomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the government would be tempted\Nto use you as a suicide weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I could only disobey them so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I decided to install a\Ntotal shutdown switch instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that it has been pressed, you\Nshould be in a vegetative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be able to respond to\Ncommands, let alone act on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't possess\Nreason, what can you act on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What drove you to Bonnie's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Science cannot explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's illogical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the tales must be true, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not their physical strength\Nthat makes Buccaneer people special.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At one point in time, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:18:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any luck here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Straw Hat just vanished on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we tell HQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dad, for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know, you weren't\Nthe only one I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy. I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you for writing\Nme so many letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reading those words made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody says that you're a tyrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know you're the nicest person ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the coolest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the best dad in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One punch ain't taking him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak, Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your explanation for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose it must look that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could say it was the\Npower of love, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it one of humanity's delusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.76,0:21:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An error in their construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's regenerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no more use for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave Bonnie alone, you spider geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with us, our asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a debt to repay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't the same crew I faced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gone back to hell already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show me? Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much you've implied!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VEGAPUNK! My dad isn't moving! Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WHAT DO WE DO?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atlas, carry him to the Lobby phase!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EASY Pass, I GOT THIS!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.02,0:22:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,QUICKLY, Atlas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LEAVE THIS ONE TO ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TAKE CARE OF Brain AND KUMA!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna let him escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.54,0:23:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we've got Kuma here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too many big\Nshots all in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better get this over with quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can't take the pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.80,0:23:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a sad man you've become,\NKizaru. That's not Borsalino I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am pathetic, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.38,0:23:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd known today would be like this, I\Nwould have wanted a darker pair of shades.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.28,0:23:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eliminate all enemies of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let none of them remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.32,0:23:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare all ships for the Buster Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.52,0:23:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island has been designated as\Na threat to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All units, prepare for bombardment!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of justice, we'll\Nburn it all to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:23:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spare no effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.56,0:23:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.04,0:23:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open fire and leave nothing behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.35,0:24:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly's a master call!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.78,0:24:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who study the forbidden\Nsecrets of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who carry traitor's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.86,0:24:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who awaken the\Nmight of an ancient god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All inconveniences,\Nall must be eradicated.
Dialogue: 11,0:24:31.70,0:24:35.11,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Conquering the world, believing in the future
Dialogue: 11,0:24:31.70,0:24:35.11,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}sekai o seishite mirai o shinjite
Dialogue: 11,0:24:36.96,0:24:40.38,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}What did you see, what did you learn?
Dialogue: 11,0:24:36.96,0:24:40.38,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}nani o mite nani o shitte
Dialogue: 11,0:24:43.00,0:24:48.26,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Once again, I couldn't save a soul
Dialogue: 11,0:24:43.00,0:24:48.26,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mata daremo mamorenai no
Dialogue: 11,0:24:48.26,0:24:53.06,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}My fault their voices're fading away
Dialogue: 11,0:24:48.26,0:24:53.06,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}kiekakaru koe wa boku no sei
Dialogue: 11,0:24:53.06,0:24:55.35,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Don't even have time to hang my head
Dialogue: 11,0:24:53.06,0:24:55.35,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}utsumuku hima mo nai no
Dialogue: 11,0:24:55.35,0:24:57.94,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Gravel marks on my palms
Dialogue: 11,0:24:55.35,0:24:57.94,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}tenohira ni tsuku jari no ato
Dialogue: 11,0:24:57.94,0:25:01.73,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We're setting off again, my ship!
Dialogue: 11,0:24:57.94,0:25:01.73,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mata ugokidase boku no fune yo
Dialogue: 11,0:25:01.73,0:25:06.82,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Though I can't fly in the open skies
Dialogue: 11,0:25:01.73,0:25:06.82,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}hiroi sora wa tobenai kedo
Dialogue: 11,0:25:06.82,0:25:12.64,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I can light up the deep sea
Dialogue: 11,0:25:06.82,0:25:12.64,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}fukai umi wa teraseru kara
Dialogue: 11,0:25:12.64,0:25:13.66,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Which is why...
Dialogue: 11,0:25:12.64,0:25:13.66,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}bokura wa
Dialogue: 11,0:25:13.66,0:25:16.16,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Everyday, we can't quit
Dialogue: 11,0:25:13.66,0:25:16.16,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY owarenai
Dialogue: 11,0:25:16.16,0:25:18.79,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Everyday, we can't lose
Dialogue: 11,0:25:16.16,0:25:18.79,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}EVERYDAY makerenai
Dialogue: 11,0:25:18.79,0:25:22.59,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We've got something right here to defend
Dialogue: 11,0:25:18.79,0:25:22.59,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}mamoru mono ga koko ni wa aru
Dialogue: 11,0:25:22.59,0:25:25.09,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Were my predictions all wrong?
Dialogue: 11,0:25:22.59,0:25:25.09,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}yosou chigai kamo
Dialogue: 11,0:25:25.09,0:25:27.82,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}But I can't stop anymore
Dialogue: 11,0:25:25.09,0:25:27.82,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}tomarenai yo mou
Dialogue: 11,0:25:27.82,0:25:33.14,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}We forge on, sharing the loneliness
Dialogue: 11,0:25:27.82,0:25:33.14,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}kodoku o ima wakeai susumu
Dialogue: 11,0:25:33.14,0:25:35.85,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Don't chicken out now
Dialogue: 11,0:25:33.14,0:25:35.85,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ojikezukuna yo
Dialogue: 11,0:25:35.85,0:25:39.81,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}I'm nothing like I used to be
Dialogue: 11,0:25:35.85,0:25:39.81,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ano hi no boku to chigau kara
Dialogue: 11,0:25:39.81,0:25:43.79,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}No one can stand in my way
Dialogue: 11,0:25:39.81,0:25:43.79,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}dare ni mo jama dekinai yo
Dialogue: 11,0:25:43.79,0:25:44.90,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}So move!
Dialogue: 11,0:25:43.79,0:25:44.90,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}saa doite
Dialogue: 11,0:25:44.90,0:25:47.37,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}Conquering the world, believing in the future,
Dialogue: 11,0:25:44.90,0:25:47.37,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}sekai o seishite mirai o shinjite
Dialogue: 11,0:25:47.37,0:25:49.85,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}counting the endless nights
Dialogue: 11,0:25:47.37,0:25:49.85,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}ikutsumo no yoru kazoete
Dialogue: 11,0:25:49.85,0:25:52.59,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}What did you see, what did you learn,
Dialogue: 11,0:25:49.85,0:25:52.59,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}nani o mite nani o shitte
Dialogue: 11,0:25:52.59,0:25:56.15,ED21 ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}to realize what's really important?
Dialogue: 11,0:25:52.59,0:25:56.15,ED21 JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\bord2\shad3\blur3}taisetsu na koto ni kizuita no

